{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02930",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 5.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.69,
      "end_seconds": 11.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.0,
      "end_seconds": 19.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "uh, doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.83,
      "end_seconds": 24.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.58,
      "end_seconds": 36.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "text": "Honestly, it's difficulty walking, and my family pushed me to come. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.36,
      "end_seconds": 44.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.5,
      "end_seconds": 59.6,
      "duration_seconds": 13.1,
      "text": "Oh, you know, it's been like this since last night. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.65,
      "end_seconds": 65.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.64,
      "end_seconds": 69.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.6,
      "end_seconds": 74.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Any weakness climbing up your legs as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.37,
      "end_seconds": 87.49,
      "duration_seconds": 11.12,
      "text": "Yeah, um, that too. I did have a recent stomach bug at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.93,
      "end_seconds": 90.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "How about back pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.54,
      "end_seconds": 96.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.97,
      "end_seconds": 100.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "a few quick ones: fever or bladder problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.08,
      "end_seconds": 105.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "I haven't had fever or bladder problems, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.28,
      "end_seconds": 109.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.04,
      "end_seconds": 118.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "no, nothing with my heart"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.27,
      "end_seconds": 121.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.11,
      "end_seconds": 123.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Yes, eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.86,
      "end_seconds": 125.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.41,
      "end_seconds": 133.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "Anxiety, for about a year. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.19,
      "end_seconds": 141.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "mm, okay yes, eczema and anxiety are known to us, good to have that clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.47,
      "end_seconds": 157.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.41,
      "end_seconds": 163.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.39,
      "end_seconds": 169.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.5,
      "end_seconds": 175.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.36,
      "end_seconds": 182.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.65,
      "end_seconds": 187.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.17,
      "end_seconds": 203.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.33,
      "end_seconds": 207.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "No, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.99,
      "end_seconds": 211.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Okay, tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 212.33,
      "end_seconds": 222.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.82,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, she is on hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.95,
      "end_seconds": 227.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "so, I'll note down your vital signs first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.62,
      "end_seconds": 243.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Right, sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.28,
      "end_seconds": 262.38,
      "duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 18, pressure 126 over 69, heart rate 71, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.29,
      "end_seconds": 269.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.34,
      "end_seconds": 271.33,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.84,
      "end_seconds": 275.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.92,
      "end_seconds": 295.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Your ankle reflexes are absent and the strength in both legs is reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.74,
      "end_seconds": 302.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "okay, you can sit up now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.78,
      "end_seconds": 325.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, the most likely explanation is possible Guillain-Barre syndrome. I'd also keep a spinal cord problem in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.43,
      "end_seconds": 331.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.34,
      "end_seconds": 350.0,
      "duration_seconds": 17.66,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with possible Guillain-Barre syndrome do well once it's treated properly. Just to be sure I understood. You've had difficulty walking, since last night, moderate, and no bladder problems or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.67,
      "end_seconds": 354.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "That's it, you know, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.44,
      "end_seconds": 363.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Let's book an urgent admission to look into ascending weakness. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.76,
      "end_seconds": 367.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}